27:03.550 --> 27:04.250
Bapa.

27:04.590 --> 27:05.900
Akhirnya awak bangun.

27:05.920 --> 27:06.460
Bapa.

27:06.480 --> 27:07.250
Yi.

27:07.270 --> 27:09.420
